# Wan2.2 5B Shot SOP

This SOP turns GPT key images and shot notes into short local video clips for Remotion. It uses only the existing Wan2.2-TI2V-5B baseline.

## Inputs

For each shot, prepare:

- scene id
- shot id
- one key image, preferably square or close to final crop
- positive prompt
- negative prompt
- intended duration
- filename prefix

Put key images in:

```text
H:\AI\ComfyUI_Aaki_v3\ComfyUI\input
```

Suggested image name:

```text
scene##_shot##_key.png
```

## Load Baseline Workflow

Open:

```text
H:\AI\skills\comfyui-aaki-v3-video-baseline\workflows\wan22_5b_lowrisk_ui_workflow.json
```

Do not change model loader nodes:

- `wan2.2_ti2v_5B_fp16.safetensors`
- `umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors`
- `wan2.2_vae.safetensors`

## Stable First-Pass Settings

Use these when producing a new shot family:

- width: `512`
- height: `512`
- frames: `37`
- fps: `12`
- duration: `3.083333` seconds
- steps: `12`
- cfg: `5.0`
- sampler: `uni_pc`
- scheduler: `simple`
- CLIP device: `cpu`

Change only:

- input image
- positive prompt
- negative prompt
- seed
- filename prefix

## Generation Rule

Run one shot at a time. Do not queue a batch until one shot has completed and the output has been reviewed.

Record for each accepted clip:

- source image
- workflow file
- prompt text
- seed
- output path
- duration
- generation time when available

## Output Triage

Raw output:

```text
H:\AI\ComfyUI_Aaki_v3\ComfyUI\output\video
```

Copy keepers to:

```text
H:\AI\ComfyUI_Aaki_v3\ComfyUI\output\video_selected
```

Copy clips ready for Remotion to:

```text
H:\AI\ComfyUI_Aaki_v3\ComfyUI\output\remotion_inbox
```

Use this final clip name:

```text
scene##_shot##_take##_wan22_5b_512x512_12fps.mp4
```

## Accept/Reject Checklist

Accept only if:

- clip opens and plays
- motion is visible
- subject remains usable for the edit
- no severe flicker or broken anatomy
- no text/watermark artifacts
- clip is copied to `remotion_inbox` with a stable name

Reject or rerun only within the same model if:

- motion is too weak
- subject drifts too far
- face/body breaks
- composition does not match the intended shot

## Escalation Boundary

For this baseline, improvements may tune prompt, seed, frames, resolution, and input image only. Do not install or switch to other video models without a new gated task.

